OL,3,ATurning the tides: Could hidden sea
OL,4,Apower energise our coastal towns?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a secret location in the Highlands
OL,7,Fof Scotland, there's a fast-flowing
OL,8,Friver that's the key to understanding
OL,9,Fthe massive power of water.
OL,11,FIt's where engineer David Mummery found
OL,12,Fhimself more than a decade ago.
OL,14,FWith a length of cord tied tightly
OL,15,Facross the river, he swam out, gripped
OL,16,Ffirmly, and let the unstoppable current
OL,17,Frush over as he sunk his head below the
OL,18,Fsurface.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
